    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13fe74082a55c1420712408b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样下去感觉我会被莱茵超越……\n更别说现在，在三冠路线大放异彩的“那位赛马娘”了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae5b3c5c5130d088dfc81e54caf72edea45ad2c6a6d170a81632c405fed3a368",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
