    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f549d438f98d9701438292c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真是许久以来的壮举！！\n这个传说，还将延续到秋天的京都『菊花赏』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "072af5d8828ed2bf6354952f3f702da258254d8680c9846bf98e4cb798fcf269",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0202/storytimeline_020202041.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daf26dfa09c5e741fe9c6e4e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这个春天，与三后冠相对应的经典三冠路线\n有某位赛马娘以压倒性优势同时赢下了『皋月赏』『日本德比』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90c82a467542e511a82354caf298c40879f00d7b24e3b2d567673514d134916a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0202/storytimeline_020202041.json",
      "json_path": [
