    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2348ee706ced53a908e07efc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『美国橡树大赛』……居然……向我……",
      "source_fingerprint": "480adf901bbcb64f114397617c60352fbb82de6a2a1bc5a39d16799d42acf54c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0202/storytimeline_020202041.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f023276287c0797894887352",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『美国橡树大赛』。是在美国西海岸举办的G1。\n聚集了世界各地经典级后冠赛马娘的大型比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbaefba14383c31ebe87063367f381f44809a04c3bc46f58253bec6192abaf17",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0202/storytimeline_020202041.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fc73b167313699001459342",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这份邀请是意料之外的荣誉。看来西沙里奥在『橡树大赛』上的\r\n表现，吸引了美国的赛事相关人员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d21172bda75d28e85498bf7d5ff6c99e63c077ecd2760d786c067e945ec38a39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0202/storytimeline_020202041.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        55,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/55/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:587a69009add00a942fbaaf6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迄今为止，这个国家的赛马娘曾多少次挑战过国外的G1。\n欧洲首次G1获胜的是采珠……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e982c145b112b886fefb5eaf30944dc5f9e1dd510c3e9c653a6b7bdb6addd3f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0202/storytimeline_020202041.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        56,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/56/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30da7970a2fd9ae9938e82db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是在美国，还未有能实现G1获胜的日本赛马娘。\n就连那个“皇帝”鲁道夫象征都没能实现的伟业。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7de0276c771d42f03aa0a24face61258022f34f46dd0a691a68b298ac04b816",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0202/storytimeline_020202041.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        57,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/57/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75fa2acba39c235ab63b9b2d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7ea8f429e376dcab41bee5b946ee4fb9dc8e928a406a356926b617ad6aaffb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0202/storytimeline_020202041.json",
