      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那可是……极其光荣的事。如果能赢下来，\n就能取得不逊色莱茵的功绩。可是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c79ce7409333183774c5b7c0b59b32f9501384cfc20fd34160b12714bbde509f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
