    {
      "uid": "zhcn:def67dee9ac2f9a0d50d87ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我记得去年的『美国橡树大赛』……\n我们国家顶尖的赛马娘都没能取胜吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8826fba8dd0ad74b2259501304afeadbf64384aafa424903ebfd02b782bc2f2",
