    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4825404cb07c96b9408b730f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯！　在那个舞台我也会努力的！\n『樱花赏』『NHK英里杯』过后赢下『秋华赏』――",
      "source_fingerprint": "d93cf04e4746ecc8825819902afcd9fdf2a65344bd1f5987e61bf12136d59d1a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
