    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0ea385098fdfaad76d9135f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我坚定地说道。不仅是西沙里奥，\n这对于队伍＜斗宿六＞也是一个巨大的挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0c7af6aa2999a4cb986ac2b35f1ffe59f42767a1aa8dbdead364306f988adbc",
