      "uid": "zhcn:7205f81811c4f667c5db330c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我绝非想让她一个人承担。\n这堵高墙需要我们团结一心，全力以赴去挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2436e990cc94ffe8331825b8165d468223e8ce0666d06e43094f444b4b281adb",
